# Fetch main before engine overlay operations

Fetch `origin/main` before choosing or publishing an overlay version, running
`overlay-check`/`overlay-apply`, or starting an engine build. New versions use
main's current number plus one at publication; preserve other contributors'
hashes and freeze active build inputs. Apply/build requires explicit authorization.
Verify the manifest against current main or the intended frozen source before
apply, and the applied overlay against that source before build.
See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md#engine-and-release-operations).
